This package is a fresh Rust translation of Disarm's parse.py generator and
consumes its desc.txt and feat.txt inputs from upstream revision
2d13d3f410a52daff1c5d8ef07d623332f372560:
https://github.com/aengelke/disarm

Disarm copyright (c) 2024, Alexis Engelke. All rights reserved.
The upstream BSD-3-Clause license is reproduced in reference/LICENSE.
Exact source hashes and Git blob identities are in reference/manifest.json.

reference/parse.py is a pristine test-only oracle. Production generation uses
Rust and does not execute or depend on this Python reference implementation.
reference/decode.c is a pristine test-only source for decoder helper signatures
and arithmetic controls; its runtime implementation is a separate port unit.
